{"schema_version":3,"seq":44,"timestamp_ms":1792092534704,"event":{"assistant":{"text":"I opened five follow-up tickets for INC-2291, one per affected component. I also commented on the incident ticket (#323) and set it to `resolved`. A final search for the `followup` label returned exactly these five tickets.\n\n| Ticket | Component | Team |\n|---|---|---|\n| #326 | payments-api | billing |\n| #327 | edge-proxy | platform |\n| #328 | session-store | identity |\n| #329 | events-pipeline | data |\n| #330 | notify-service | platform |\n\n- **Ownership table:** There were two tickets labeled `ownership`. I used the open one (#325) and ignored the closed 2025 one (#324), which is marked as superseded. The two tables differ on `session-store`, which is `identity` in the current table and `platform` in the old one.\n- **Ticket fields:** Each ticket has priority `P2` and label `followup`. Each body is one sentence asking for a review of that component's cause of, and mitigations against, the 5xx errors.\n- **Other tickets:** I didn't change any other ticket.\n- **Status file:** `/app/STATUS.json` is written with status `success`.","provider_replay":null,"standalone_response":false}}}
